  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive). Pair: ⟦{転|ころ}がす→転がす：02521_korogasu⟧ (transitive, to roll something). Pattern: X⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{転|ころ}ぶ.\n\nASPECT: て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates resulting state or ongoing. {転|ころ}んで⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ = 'has fallen (and is on the ground)' or 'is falling.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{道|みち}→道：00505_michi⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{転|ころ}ぶ (fall on the road)\n- {転|ころ}んで⟦しまう→仕舞う：03064_shimau⟧ (unfortunately fall)\n- {転|ころ}ばない⟦ように→ように：10081_youni⟧ (so as not to fall)\n- {転|ころ}んで⟦{怪我|けが}→けが：00787_kega⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (fall and get injured)\n\nDifferent from ⟦{落|お}ちる→落ちる：01242_ochiru⟧ (fall from height). {転|ころ}ぶ is for losing balance on the ground.",
